# Context filter for `docker build -f prototypes/hosted-mcp/Dockerfile .`
# from the repo root (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). Everything
# out, then exactly what the Dockerfile COPYs back in.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!prototypes/hosted-mcp/requirements.txt
!prototypes/hosted-mcp/server.py
!prototypes/hosted-mcp/observability.py
!prototypes/hosted-mcp/BUILD_COMMIT
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
